1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,291
Chapéu… fita vermelha…

2
00:00:03,375 --> 00:00:05,393
Não empurra o mano…

3
00:00:05,511 --> 00:00:06,383
Me empurrar?

4
00:00:06,437 --> 00:00:06,909
Quem?

5
00:00:07,402 --> 00:00:08,185
O remédio tá pronto!

6
00:00:08,741 --> 00:00:09,931
Febre alta demais,

7
00:00:10,014 --> 00:00:11,222
não adianta.

8
00:00:11,552 --> 00:00:12,643
Aqui não tem médico.

9
00:00:13,367 --> 00:00:14,869
Toque de recolher,

10
00:00:14,938 --> 00:00:16,006
portão fechado.

11
00:00:17,032 --> 00:00:18,192
Uma hora de estrada,

12
00:00:18,263 --> 00:00:19,101
não aguenta.

13
00:00:21,469 --> 00:00:23,280
Missão urgente:

14
00:00:23,358 --> 00:00:27,142
ao raiar, Xiaohe sem febre.

15
00:00:29,195 --> 00:00:30,014
Me dá o cavalo.

16
00:00:30,395 --> 00:00:31,267
Confio em você.

17
00:00:33,595 --> 00:00:34,923
A-Ling sabe montar?!

18
00:00:35,386 --> 00:00:36,813
Isso é de cavalaria.

19
00:00:37,011 --> 00:00:38,329
Quem é ela, afinal?

20
00:00:38,671 --> 00:00:40,183
Rua Leste, Doutor Bai!

21
00:00:50,055 --> 00:00:50,520
Toque de recolher!

22
00:00:50,784 --> 00:00:52,002
Tem bandido, volta!

23
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,862
Mulher a cavalo, é?

24
00:00:54,203 --> 00:00:54,835
Saiam.

25
00:00:55,403 --> 00:00:56,736
Avança e te prendo!

26
00:01:02,077 --> 00:01:02,802
Arqueiros!

27
00:01:02,857 --> 00:01:03,443
Atrás dela!

28
00:01:05,531 --> 00:01:06,394
Mano…

29
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:09,186
Ela tomou!

30
00:01:09,257 --> 00:01:09,749
O mano tá aqui.

31
00:01:09,802 --> 00:01:11,557
Aguenta até a A-Ling voltar.

32
00:01:13,457 --> 00:01:14,162
Doutor Bai!

33
00:01:14,333 --> 00:01:15,156
Abre!

34
00:01:15,262 --> 00:01:17,432
Já vai, já vai,

35
00:01:18,819 --> 00:01:20,666
que barulho.

36
00:01:22,486 --> 00:01:23,298
Parada!

37
00:01:27,686 --> 00:01:28,962
Arqueiros, mirem.

38
00:01:31,852 --> 00:01:32,301
Fogo—
